"<AccordionItem title=\"True or false: Quantum computing was first conceptualized in the 1990s.\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Benar atau salah: Pengkomputeran kuantum pertama kali dikonseptualisasikan pada tahun 1990-an.\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "False.  While the first experimental quantum computer was created in 1998, the potential for quantum computing was identified by Richard Feynman as far back as 1981.\n"
msgstr "Salah. Walaupun komputer kuantum eksperimen pertama dicipta pada tahun 1998, potensi pengkomputeran kuantum telah dikenal pasti oleh Richard Feynman seawal 1981.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key takeaways {#key-takeaways}"
msgstr "Pengambilan utama {#key-takeaways}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can keep these key takeaways in mind:\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh mengingati pengambilan utama ini:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum computing represents a new computing paradigm that can work in unison with conventional computers.\n"
msgstr "Pengkomputeran kuantum mewakili paradigma pengkomputeran baru yang boleh bekerja bersama komputer konvensional.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "It will enable us to understand our world differently and solve some previously intractable problems.\n"
msgstr "Ia akan membolehkan kita memahami dunia kita secara berbeza dan menyelesaikan beberapa masalah yang sebelumnya tidak dapat diselesaikan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "While quantum computing cannot yet outperform methods in use today, organizations can take steps today to prepare for this fundamental change in computing.\n"
msgstr "Walaupun pengkomputeran kuantum belum dapat mengatasi kaedah yang digunakan hari ini, organisasi boleh mengambil langkah hari ini untuk bersedia menghadapi perubahan asas dalam pengkomputeran ini.\n"

